// Short staging tags demo (docs/STAGING.md). Start it with cue "start".
~ start
The classroom, this time as a 3D stage. [#stage=classroom, #show=maya@door, #music=calm]
Maya: Morning! [#move=maya@desk?t=0.9, #anim=maya:wave]
Rook: Late again. [#show=rook@guest_desk, #focus=rook]
Maya: Am not! [#show=maya:surprised, #focus=maya]
Ken: Made it! ...Wait, the bell already rang? [#show=ken:surprised@door, #focus=ken]
Rook: Ten minutes ago. [#show=rook:smile, #focus=rook]
Ken: Ugh. Sorry. [#show=ken:sad, #focus=ken]
[#hide=maya@hall, #hide=ken@hall]
Rook: ...Back to the flat stage, then. [#stage=2d, #bg=rooftop]
Maya: Two slots were never enough. [#show=maya:smile@far_left, #show=rook@far_right, #show=ken:smile@center, #focus=maya]
Ken: Room for one more! [#anim=ken:wave, #focus=ken]
Rook: Show-off. [#move=rook?by=-160 0, #show=rook:sad, #focus=rook]
=> END
